@startuml
title Relational Access V1 - L1 Access Selection
autonumber

participant "Component Repository" as Repo
participant "Physical Route Resolver" as Route
participant "MyBatisAccessResolver" as Resolver
participant "MyBatisAccess" as Access

Repo -> Route : resolve(operation context)
Route --> Repo : dataSourceKey + tableName
Repo -> Resolver : resolve(dataSourceKey)

alt key is null
  Resolver --> Repo : default logical Access
else Direct physical key
  Resolver --> Repo : Access bound to physical DataSource
else middleware logical key
  Resolver --> Repo : Access bound to ShardingSphere or Proxy entry
end

Repo -> Access : execute*(Mapper, tableName)

note over Route,Resolver
The same String selects an application-side Access.
Only in Direct mode does it normally identify a physical DB.
end note
@enduml
